WEBVTT

00:14:03.797 --> 00:14:08.093
You’re a piece of a dream now

00:14:09.261 --> 00:14:12.472
Just a little too far

00:14:14.558 --> 00:14:18.854
I can still hear your voice through

00:14:20.439 --> 00:14:23.400
The door left ajar

00:14:25.527 --> 00:14:29.281
I guess that’s how it is now --